      "text": "class MazeGen(BaseModel):\n    height     : int\n    width      : int\n    perfect    : bool\n    entry      : Vector<int, int>\n    exit       : Vector<int, int>\n    output_file: str\n    seed       : int\n\n\n1. Break walls of a specific cell.\n1.1 Break mirroring walls.\n2. Talk to the algorithm to know\nwhich wall to break.\n3. Validate its structure.\n",
